% holding-blocked: This original is licence-safe and fully notated, but it has not been tried with children. A JK classroom trial, an early-years music teacher, an accessibility-minded music educator and a second score reader must check that children can strike a bell softly and then wait through a silent bar, that one silent bar at quarter = 72 is long enough to hear a bell fade, the re-entry on A4 after bar 4, and how Evelyn Glennie is introduced.
